{
  "AC": "Persisted top-level tags field exists, in ALLOWED_TOP_LEVEL_FIELDS and accepted by doctor; CLI can set/add/remove tags and they survive re-read; tags searchable via a field-scoped term; SKILL.md Record shape documents the field; tests cover set/persist/remove and search-by-tag.",
  "ActualSummary": "Added a persisted top-level Tags field. set --tag/--untag (repeatable) edits it, kept sorted+deduped and dropped when the last tag is removed; doctor validates Tags is a list of non-empty strings; search --tag=a,b filters to todos whose Tags intersect the list (ANY-match), applied before ranking like --state. Registered Tags in ALLOWED_TOP_LEVEL_FIELDS and documented it in SKILL.md, distinct from the ephemeral zero-shot tag command (ef4ad78d), which stays read-only. 135 tests green, incl. 6 new tag tests and an end-to-end.",
  "BaseSha": "2695974b0f60763dd5eccd21d62ec244712c16f7",
