    "raw": "Requirement (corrected): todos need PERSISTED tags. Tags must be stored\ndurably on the todo and be user-settable, not recomputed and discarded.\n\nBackground / why this exists: ef4ad78d (\"Zero-shot semantic tagging\") shipped a\n`tag` command that computes {embedder:{tag:score}} at read-time and explicitly\ndoes NOT persist -- recomputed every run, never written to the store. That\nnon-persistence was a MISUNDERSTANDING of the requirement; nobody wanted\nephemeral tags. This todo delivers the persisted, explicit version.\n\nScope:\n- Add a persisted top-level `tags` field to the todo record and to\n  ALLOWED_TOP_LEVEL_FIELDS (todo.py ~1782) so `doctor` accepts it; document it\n  in SKILL.md \"Record shape\".\n- CLI to set/add/remove tags explicitly, persisted (sqlite-only edit for a\n  pre-init todo; commit on a branch todo like other `set` edits).\n- Search/filter by tag via a field-scoped `tag:` term, coordinating with the\n  grooming backlog 5b446160 item 2 (weighted field-scoped search) so the work\n  is not duplicated.\n\nRelationship to the semantic tagger (ef4ad78d): the semantic `tag` command may\nPROPOSE/seed tags, but acceptance writes them into the persisted field. Decide\nwhether `tag` gains a --write/--accept mode or a separate promote step feeds\nthe persisted field.\n\nOpen decisions (resolve before init):\n1. Tag shape: flat list of strings ([\"billing\",\"ui\"]) vs retained provenance\n   (user vs machine, or {source:{tag:score}}). Recommend flat strings for user\n   tags; keep any machine suggestions separate.\n2. CLI surface: --tag/--untag flags on `set` vs a dedicated `tag add|rm`\n   subcommand.\n3. Fate of the ephemeral semantic `tag` output: keep as-is, give it a persist\n   mode, or fold it in.\n4. Search grammar: `tag:foo` term ties to 5b446160 field-scoped search;\n   coordinate ordering/dependency between the two todos.\n\nTouch points: todo.py (ALLOWED_TOP_LEVEL_FIELDS, `set` args + argparse, doctor,\nsearch filter grammar), todo_store.py / todo_db.py (only if a chosen shape needs\nindexing; otherwise the field rides in the JSON `data` blob), SKILL.md (Record\nshape + CLI table). Tests: test_todo.py.\n\nIsolation: repo jovlinger/utils; work in an exclusive worktree of this todo's\nbranch, main checkout stays on master."
